# Firmware

This folder contains the embedded firmware for the Semi-Automated MCB Tester.

## Firmware Components

### STM32

The STM32 is used as the main controller for:

- Test sequence control
- DRV8825 stepper motor control
- MCB trip detection
- Sensor interfacing
- Communication

### ESP32

The ESP32 measurement subsystem is used for current measurement using the SCT-013-000 CT sensor.

